<title>SPAIN: Spain sees Q1 GDP up around 2.8 yr/yr - press.</title>
<headline>Spain sees Q1 GDP up around 2.8 yr/yr - press.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's gross domestic product is expected to grow around 2.8 percent in the first quarter, newspaper El Pais said on Monday quoting official estimates.</p>
<p>Private consumption should accelerate to 2.5 percent.</p>
<p>In the fourth quarter 1996 Spain's GDP rose 2.6 percent year on year, for a yearly average 2.2 percent rate.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
